        <name>skewness</name>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>returns the skewness, defined as <formula id="256">\[ \frac{N^2}{(N-1)(N-2)} \frac{\left\langle \left( x-\langle x \rangle \right)^3 \right\rangle}{\sigma^3}. \]</formula> The above evaluates to 0 for a Gaussian distribution. </para>        </detaileddescription>
        <location file="C:/Develop/QuantLib-1.2.1/ql/math/statistics/incrementalstatistics.hpp" line="79"/>
      </memberdef>
