        <definition>Real kurtosis</definition>
        <argsstring>() const </argsstring>
        <name>kurtosis</name>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>returns the excess kurtosis, defined as <formula id="257">\[ \frac{N^2(N+1)}{(N-1)(N-2)(N-3)} \frac{\left\langle \left(x-\langle x \rangle \right)^4 \right\rangle}{\sigma^4} - \frac{3(N-1)^2}{(N-2)(N-3)}. \]</formula> The above evaluates to 0 for a Gaussian distribution. </para>        </detaileddescription>
        <location file="C:/Develop/QuantLib-1.2.1/ql/math/statistics/incrementalstatistics.hpp" line="87"/>
      </memberdef>
